      "severity": "P1 (conditional local secret exposure) / P2 (provenance)",
      "status": "fixed",
      "title": "Packaging could include ignored secrets and label stale dist as the current commit",
      "evidence": "package_release iterated every regular integration file, including ignored .env, and never rebuilt ignored dist before assigning source_commit=HEAD. Synthetic tests reproduced both conditions.",
      "fix": "Explicit integration inputs, reject symlinked inputs, pin toolchain, frozen install/tests/fresh build before packaging, verify final archives, and record checks actually executed instead of old validation counts.",
      "paths": [
        "tools/package_release.py"
      ],
