      "status": "fixed",
      "title": "Candidate security/runtime fixes needed explicit review evidence without overwriting v0.0.2",
      "fix": "Add strict optional audit delta schema and anchored before/after chain; reject unknown paths/fields/duplicates/empty evidence. Ops validator reports runtime_changed=true and types_only=false for approved runtime changes. CI executes Python and Node checker regressions.",
